UISpriteSequencePlayer:Sprite {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Extensions/UISpriteSequencePlayer.h#UISpriteSequencePlayer:Sprite
    src   "No PostEditChangeProperty override. There was one, and its body was an empty `if (Property)` --\nso it did nothing except look like the sheet player's, which has real work to do (that one\nre-resolves its texture and puts the UV rect back when the preview is off). An override that\nonly calls Super is one more place a reader has to go and check."
    text  "没有重写 PostEditChangeProperty。以前有一个，但它的函数体是空的 `if (Property)`——\n除了看起来和图集播放器的一样之外什么也没做，而那个播放器有实际工作要做（它在预览关闭时会\n重新解析纹理并还原 UV 矩形）。只调用 Super 的重写只是多了一处\n阅读者必须去查看的地方。"
    state machine
}
